{"name":"Aragon","hex":"#b06455","fetched":"2026-11-01","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"Aragon","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Proper noun","definitions":["An autonomous community in northeastern Spain. Capital: Zaragoza.","A river in the autonomous communities of Aragon and Navarre, Spain; in full, Aragon River."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/Aragon"}],"entries":[{"title":"Aragon","blocks":[{"text":"Aragon is an autonomous community in Spain, coextensive with the medieval Kingdom of Aragon. In northeastern Spain, the Aragonese autonomous community comprises three provinces : Huesca, Zaragoza, and Teruel. Its capital is Zaragoza. The current Statute of Autonomy declares Aragon a historic nationality of Spain."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/18/Flag_of_Aragon.svg/330px-Flag_of_Aragon.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Aragon","wikidata":"Q4040"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e7/Murallaromanadezaragoza.JPG/500px-Murallaromanadezaragoza.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e7/Murallaromanadezaragoza.JPG/1280px-Murallaromanadezaragoza.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e7/Murallaromanadezaragoza.JPG/500px-Murallaromanadezaragoza.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"The remains of the Roman walls of Zaragoza","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AMurallaromanadezaragoza.JPG"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/88/WLM14ES_-_Zaragoza_Exposici%C3%B3n_sobre_Augusto_00006_-_.jpg/500px-WLM14ES_-_Zaragoza_Exposici%C3%B3n_sobre_Augusto_00006_-_.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https